WEBVTT

00:00:42.731 --> 00:00:43.763
[This drama is a work of fiction.]

00:00:43.763 --> 00:00:44.802
[Any resemblance to real persons,
places, or events is coincidental.]

00:00:44.802 --> 00:00:45.841
[Scenes with child actors and animals
were filmed safely]

00:00:45.841 --> 00:00:47.137
[under professional supervision.]

00:00:47.986 --> 00:00:51.538
[Nine years prior]

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:04.711
Yes, Director Jo.

00:01:04.711 --> 00:01:07.005
Hello, Chief Prosecutor.

00:01:07.005 --> 00:01:08.865
How far out are you?

00:01:08.865 --> 00:01:11.350
Roughly ten minutes to go.

00:01:12.135 --> 00:01:14.596
We're looking at ten minutes or so.

00:01:14.596 --> 00:01:15.814
Yes.

00:01:15.814 --> 00:01:18.480
It's a fine occasion, so no need to rush.

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:20.234
Yes.

00:01:26.358 --> 00:01:28.190
[Episode 4]

00:01:37.703 --> 00:01:39.587
I think we've arrived.

00:01:43.856 --> 00:01:45.942
I appreciate you making the long trip.

00:01:45.942 --> 00:01:49.096
The chairman got here early
and is expecting you.

00:01:54.803 --> 00:01:56.479
Right this way.

00:02:17.105 --> 00:02:18.668
Hey.

00:02:25.834 --> 00:02:27.627
There's no crew in sight.

00:02:27.627 --> 00:02:29.888
Is this actually where we're filming today?

00:02:29.888 --> 00:02:31.188
Yeah.

00:02:31.188 --> 00:02:33.008
If today's filming goes smoothly,

00:02:33.008 --> 00:02:37.395
CEO Oh agreed to forget what you pulled on set.

00:02:57.657 --> 00:02:59.993
- Over here.
- Yes.

00:03:01.355 --> 00:03:03.045
Get over here.

00:03:05.689 --> 00:03:07.758
Hey, you head in first.

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:32.700
Oh, you're here?

00:03:33.981 --> 00:03:35.987
- Sir.
- Long trip, huh?

00:03:35.987 --> 00:03:37.823
Come in.

00:03:41.247 --> 00:03:42.953
We're filming today, right?

00:03:42.953 --> 00:03:45.713
I didn't see any of the crew.

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:01.179
Sir.

00:04:01.179 --> 00:04:03.473
This isn't a shoot, is it?

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:06.776
Something more important.

00:04:14.022 --> 00:04:16.151
Chairman, and Chief Prosecutor.

00:04:16.151 --> 00:04:18.029
Thank you for your patience.

00:04:18.029 --> 00:04:20.448
This is Han Ji Soo,
a new actress I just brought on.

00:04:20.448 --> 00:04:26.211
Great voice,
and she really knows how to use her body.

00:04:29.981 --> 00:04:32.335
What's the holdup?

00:04:32.335 --> 00:04:34.386
Introduce yourself, yeah?

00:05:09.227 --> 00:05:11.215
Yes, Chief Prosecutor.

00:05:13.939 --> 00:05:15.719
Oh, yes.

00:05:17.814 --> 00:05:19.925
Oh, I'll have it there shortly.

00:05:19.925 --> 00:05:21.623
Yes.

00:05:36.105 --> 00:05:37.692
Somebody help.

00:05:37.692 --> 00:05:40.452
Please, somebody help!

00:05:46.689 --> 00:05:48.877
What the hell do you think you're doing?

00:06:08.515 --> 00:06:10.225
Hey.

00:06:10.225 --> 00:06:12.858
Easy there.

00:06:12.858 --> 00:06:15.070
You almost hurt her.

00:06:16.188 --> 00:06:17.438
Ji Soo,

00:06:17.438 --> 00:06:19.651
are you okay?

00:06:19.651 --> 00:06:24.033
What is this...

00:06:24.033 --> 00:06:27.617
Just stay still. Don't make a scene.

00:06:27.617 --> 00:06:29.960
My apologies, Chairman.

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:40.304
It's alright.

00:06:58.948 --> 00:07:02.326
Anything else I can get you?

00:07:03.254 --> 00:07:05.496
That'll do. Head out.

00:07:06.208 --> 00:07:11.043
Okay,
all non-essentials can step out now, please.

00:07:12.662 --> 00:07:14.505
Let's go.

00:07:51.034 --> 00:07:53.212
I believe

00:07:53.212 --> 00:07:56.464
everything fell apart from that night on.

00:07:57.331 --> 00:08:01.885
So that's the moment
all these lives got tangled.

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:04.011
But

00:08:04.011 --> 00:08:06.390
following that night's events,

00:08:07.647 --> 00:08:09.719
Han Ji Soo passed away.

00:08:09.719 --> 00:08:13.723
[Actress Han Ji Soo Found Dead at Home]

00:08:22.190 --> 00:08:23.730
What are we going to do with Sang Ah?

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:26.248
She hasn't been herself
since the Ji Soo story hit.

00:08:26.248 --> 00:08:27.820
Filming's been called off too,

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:31.081
and the reporters out there have us boxed in.

00:08:33.355 --> 00:08:34.737
Sang Ah!

00:08:34.737 --> 00:08:36.018
Let me call you back.

00:08:36.018 --> 00:08:37.372
Where are you going?

00:08:37.372 --> 00:08:38.957
Sang Ah!

00:09:30.383 --> 00:09:32.480
Sang Ah, wake up!

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:35.896
No more photos! I told you to stop!

00:10:07.879 --> 00:10:13.342
[I've made dinner]
[I'll be there soon]

00:10:13.342 --> 00:10:19.097
[Why aren't you picking up?
Nothing's wrong, right?]

00:10:27.774 --> 00:10:31.683
[I'll take only the good memories with me.
Thank you for everything. Goodbye]

00:10:36.861 --> 00:10:39.427
[I'll take only the good memories with me.
Thank you for everything. Goodbye]

00:11:15.482 --> 00:11:16.740
Hello.

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:20.535
My name's Park Jae Sang,
and I'll be at your service from today.

00:11:20.535 --> 00:11:22.355
Oh Kwang Jae

00:11:22.355 --> 00:11:25.712
had been managing Chu Sang Ah's affairs
since she was without an agency,

00:11:25.712 --> 00:11:27.883
and following that incident,

00:11:28.626 --> 00:11:31.869
he put me on as her personal security.

00:11:31.869 --> 00:11:34.097
Security in name only, though,

00:11:35.050 --> 00:11:37.939
because with Chu Sang Ah spiraling,

00:11:37.939 --> 00:11:40.122
the real job was surveillance.

00:11:40.122 --> 00:11:42.397
But I didn't mind.

00:11:43.596 --> 00:11:46.814
Once I got out of juvenile hall as a kid,
I had nothing to look forward to.

00:11:46.814 --> 00:11:51.022
But Chu Sang Ah was my first love,

00:11:51.022 --> 00:11:54.034
and being near her was
the one thing I ever wished for.

00:11:57.563 --> 00:11:59.198
And who approved that?

00:11:59.198 --> 00:12:02.368
CEO Oh told me to...

00:12:02.368 --> 00:12:04.814
I believe she caught on

00:12:04.814 --> 00:12:06.163
that I was there to monitor her.

00:12:06.163 --> 00:12:07.967
Go away.

00:12:12.874 --> 00:12:14.296
Look,

00:12:14.296 --> 00:12:16.765
we have to leave immediately...

00:12:17.454 --> 00:12:20.595
CEO Oh told me to come get you.

00:12:20.595 --> 00:12:22.438
What?

00:12:22.438 --> 00:12:25.690
He sent me to take you
to Han Ji Soo's funeral...

00:12:46.787 --> 00:12:51.091
[May she find eternal peace]

00:13:40.855 --> 00:13:42.793
I'm sorry.

00:13:42.793 --> 00:13:46.438
I can't even face you.
I should've taken care of it properly.

00:13:59.485 --> 00:14:03.146
Forward the reshoot invoice

00:14:03.146 --> 00:14:05.773
and equity agreement to Ji Soo's agency,

00:14:05.773 --> 00:14:08.495
and let the director know
Seon Young's replacing Ji Soo.

00:14:08.495 --> 00:14:10.629
Understood.

00:14:29.612 --> 00:14:31.483
What are you doing?

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:41.785
Murderer.

00:14:46.438 --> 00:14:48.792
Ji Soo's dead because of you.

00:14:54.605 --> 00:14:56.334
Yeah.

00:14:56.334 --> 00:14:58.502
I couldn't keep Ji Soo safe.

00:14:58.502 --> 00:15:01.672
You're the reason Ji Soo's gone.

00:15:01.672 --> 00:15:04.724
You murdered her!

00:15:07.730 --> 00:15:09.938
Are you drunk?

00:15:13.730 --> 00:15:16.688
I'm done seeing you fall apart over Ji Soo.

00:15:16.688 --> 00:15:18.822
That's it.

00:15:19.855 --> 00:15:22.605
What did you do to Ji Soo?

00:15:22.605 --> 00:15:26.146
Say it! Answer me! Spit it out!

00:15:26.146 --> 00:15:28.157
What did you do to her? Tell me!

00:15:28.157 --> 00:15:29.742
- Fuck!
- Let's go.

00:15:29.742 --> 00:15:31.285
Let go! You bastard.

00:15:31.285 --> 00:15:32.814
- Let go!
- Let's go.

00:15:32.814 --> 00:15:34.772
Let go!

00:15:34.772 --> 00:15:36.381
Let go!

00:15:38.522 --> 00:15:40.427
That's enough.

00:15:41.755 --> 00:15:43.380
Wait a second.

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:44.956
You...

00:15:47.438 --> 00:15:49.853
Mark my words.

00:15:50.438 --> 00:15:53.940
I'll drag you straight to hell.

00:16:38.769 --> 00:16:40.582
[Oh Kwang Jae, Kwon Se Myeong]

00:16:42.648 --> 00:16:44.491
[Oh Kwang Jae and Kwon Se Myeong,
from partners to sworn brothers]

00:16:46.986 --> 00:16:48.552
[Oh Kwang Jae and Kwon Se Myeong first met]

00:16:48.552 --> 00:16:50.082
[at the 2016 Hallyu Cultural
Business Agreement Ceremony]

00:16:50.082 --> 00:16:53.024
[The two have since become sworn brothers]

00:16:54.105 --> 00:16:56.920
Sworn brothers...

00:16:58.022 --> 00:17:00.750
Anything else I can get you?

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:02.919
That'll do. Head out.

00:17:05.047 --> 00:17:09.057
Okay, all non-essentials
can step out now, please.

00:17:19.727 --> 00:17:21.956
[The two have since become sworn brothers]

00:17:23.939 --> 00:17:29.892
[Chu Sang Ah, Emotional Spiral and Series of
No-Shows After Han Ji Soo's Death]

00:17:31.489 --> 00:17:33.100
[Chu Sang Ah is reportedly in deep shock
following Han Ji Soo's death.]

00:18:13.281 --> 00:18:15.700
Once Han Ji Soo passed away,

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:18.449
she began behaving erratically on set,

00:18:18.449 --> 00:18:21.070
and on top of that she got an eating disorder
and her health declined,

00:18:21.070 --> 00:18:23.089
so Oh Kwang Jae

00:18:24.022 --> 00:18:26.593
all but imprisoned her

00:18:27.355 --> 00:18:29.471
and began holding her captive.

00:20:25.897 --> 00:20:27.433
Hello?

00:20:27.433 --> 00:20:29.757
Is this the police?

00:20:38.510 --> 00:20:41.936
Word is you visited Lawyer Choi
to ask about the penalty fees.

00:20:47.105 --> 00:20:49.235
Oh Kwang Jae,

00:20:50.396 --> 00:20:52.317
what the hell have you done to me?

00:20:52.317 --> 00:20:54.734
Sang Ah, don't go down this road.

00:20:54.734 --> 00:20:56.096
You already know.

00:20:56.096 --> 00:20:58.620
There's no getting away from me.

00:21:00.531 --> 00:21:02.905
[Oh Kwang Jae]

00:21:21.109 --> 00:21:22.683
You're aware there aren't just one

00:21:22.683 --> 00:21:25.271
or two files like this on my hard drive, right?

00:21:26.891 --> 00:21:29.692
Oh Kwang Jae!

00:21:30.978 --> 00:21:33.023
I don't want to push it this far either,

00:21:33.023 --> 00:21:35.609
so for now, stay put.

00:21:35.609 --> 00:21:38.076
Just remain at home and lie low.

00:21:38.778 --> 00:21:40.488
Oh, peek out your window.

00:21:40.488 --> 00:21:42.115
Notice who's out there?

00:21:42.115 --> 00:21:45.041
If you have to leave, speak to him.

00:24:09.082 --> 00:24:12.021
Cut! Okay!

00:24:12.891 --> 00:24:15.024
Are you alright?

00:24:18.355 --> 00:24:20.988
Prepping for the next scene!

00:24:21.689 --> 00:24:23.533
You alright?

00:24:55.084 --> 00:24:57.984
What made her into a monster,

00:24:58.772 --> 00:25:00.355
at the end of the day,

00:25:00.355 --> 00:25:03.114
was Oh Kwang Jae. That's what I figured out.

00:25:05.814 --> 00:25:08.077
Let's pause here for a second.

00:25:11.522 --> 00:25:13.024
Park Jae Sang,

00:25:13.024 --> 00:25:16.300
doesn't something feel wrong to you here?

00:25:16.300 --> 00:25:17.305
What do you...

00:25:17.305 --> 00:25:20.824
Have you still not sorted out
your feelings for Chu Sang Ah?

00:25:20.824 --> 00:25:24.176
This keeps sliding
into Chu Sang Ah coming off as a victim.

00:25:24.818 --> 00:25:27.506
If that's how it goes,
it won't fit our thumbnail for today,

00:25:27.506 --> 00:25:30.385
and if this goes on air and viewers start
feeling sorry for Chu Sang Ah,

00:25:30.385 --> 00:25:33.102
you're the only one
who looks like a psycho stalker.

00:25:35.981 --> 00:25:38.397
Anyway,

00:25:38.397 --> 00:25:40.398
what's the next issue?

00:25:40.398 --> 00:25:42.397
The Oh Kwang Jae files.

00:25:42.397 --> 00:25:43.939
The ones I received before?

00:25:43.939 --> 00:25:45.531
Yes.

00:25:47.816 --> 00:25:51.655
[Oh Kwang Jae's Entertainment List,
Chu Sang Ah]

00:25:51.655 --> 00:25:53.074
[Investor, Kwon Se Myeong]

00:25:53.074 --> 00:25:55.163
When and where did you say you captured this?

00:25:55.163 --> 00:25:56.660
Oh Kwang Jae told me

00:25:56.660 --> 00:25:58.912
to pick something up from his office,

00:25:58.912 --> 00:26:01.374
and I noticed her name by chance,
so I snapped a picture.

00:26:01.374 --> 00:26:03.559
Let's pass on this one.

00:26:04.743 --> 00:26:06.802
What else did we have?

00:26:08.363 --> 00:26:11.057
Sang Ah almost died,

00:26:14.313 --> 00:26:16.604
and you're just going to gloss over that?

00:26:20.438 --> 00:26:23.611
This is what made her say she wanted to die,

00:26:25.230 --> 00:26:28.282
that the only escape from Oh Kwang Jae

00:26:29.004 --> 00:26:31.772
was for one of them to end up dead,

00:26:31.772 --> 00:26:33.829
and that's why

00:26:35.313 --> 00:26:38.000
she told me to kill him.

00:26:47.230 --> 00:26:49.178
Let go!

00:26:50.173 --> 00:26:52.390
Let go.

00:27:39.306 --> 00:27:40.639
Park Jae Sang.

00:27:40.639 --> 00:27:42.288
[Case Summary Report]

00:27:42.288 --> 00:27:44.487
You're the suspect arrested at the crime scene.

00:27:44.487 --> 00:27:47.647
Then why deny the allegations at this point?

00:27:47.647 --> 00:27:50.995
Yes, I went with the intent to kill him.

00:27:50.995 --> 00:27:53.326
But I didn't actually do it.

00:27:53.326 --> 00:27:56.030
If you insist on denying the charges,

00:27:56.030 --> 00:27:59.331
let's change our angle of approach.

00:28:00.063 --> 00:28:02.619
So your position is...

00:28:02.619 --> 00:28:05.288
Chu Sang Ah, suffering
under the Oh Kwang Jae files,

00:28:05.288 --> 00:28:07.438
gave the order to kill him

00:28:07.438 --> 00:28:09.124
but you didn't carry it out yourself.

00:28:09.124 --> 00:28:10.885
Is that correct?

00:28:12.313 --> 00:28:14.003
Yes.

00:28:14.003 --> 00:28:16.056
Well, in that case...

00:28:19.387 --> 00:28:21.228
Chu Sang Ah.

00:28:26.188 --> 00:28:28.480
How did you get dragged

00:28:28.480 --> 00:28:31.202
into those files?

00:28:31.202 --> 00:28:33.943
I needed to keep the other actresses safe.

00:28:33.943 --> 00:28:35.736
And that led you

00:28:35.736 --> 00:28:38.735
to commission a killing.

00:28:38.735 --> 00:28:40.831
What do you mean by that?

00:28:41.783 --> 00:28:43.411
Park Jae Sang insists

00:28:43.411 --> 00:28:48.089
that you ordered Oh Kwang Jae's murder.

00:28:51.730 --> 00:28:53.803
Is there any truth to that?

00:28:54.662 --> 00:28:56.597
I'll admit

00:28:57.188 --> 00:29:00.392
I wished Oh Kwang Jae
would simply cease to exist.

00:29:01.290 --> 00:29:04.563
So I'm not able to completely deny it.

00:29:07.272 --> 00:29:09.819
But let me ask you, Prosecutor.

00:29:11.646 --> 00:29:16.067
Has there never been a person you wanted

00:29:16.067 --> 00:29:18.494
to just vanish from your life?

00:29:20.146 --> 00:29:22.039
With all your heart.

00:29:31.581 --> 00:29:34.105
But I didn't ask

00:29:34.105 --> 00:29:36.679
for him to be killed.

00:29:40.218 --> 00:29:42.303
She told me

00:29:42.303 --> 00:29:45.729
she hoped Oh Kwang Jae would die.

00:29:49.022 --> 00:29:52.444
I asked whether she commissioned his killing.

00:29:54.563 --> 00:29:56.657
Commissioned...

00:30:04.063 --> 00:30:05.791
Darn it.

00:30:08.203 --> 00:30:09.915
Did Chu Sang Ah

00:30:09.915 --> 00:30:12.339
offer money or anything

00:30:13.105 --> 00:30:15.378
to officially contract you

00:30:15.378 --> 00:30:18.596
to take his life?

00:30:19.855 --> 00:30:22.182
That's the question here.

00:30:28.016 --> 00:30:29.773
Sang Ah.

00:30:33.855 --> 00:30:35.738
Sang Ah.

00:30:49.772 --> 00:30:50.997
Sang Ah!

00:30:50.997 --> 00:30:53.480
Sang Ah.

00:30:53.480 --> 00:30:56.105
Please wake up.

00:30:56.105 --> 00:30:58.177
Please.

00:30:59.296 --> 00:31:02.926
Sang Ah. Open your eyes. Please?

00:31:04.063 --> 00:31:07.144
Sang Ah, please.

00:31:10.225 --> 00:31:12.900
Just hold on a second.

00:31:17.189 --> 00:31:20.355
If they take me to the ER now,

00:31:20.355 --> 00:31:23.695
it hits the press instantly. You get that?

00:31:23.695 --> 00:31:26.283
Are you really that clueless?

00:31:27.939 --> 00:31:29.917
I'm sorry.

00:31:53.852 --> 00:31:56.689
You should've just

00:31:56.689 --> 00:31:59.863
let me die like this.

00:32:01.897 --> 00:32:03.927
Why did you...

00:32:07.313 --> 00:32:10.708
The truth is, I wanted to live.

00:32:12.230 --> 00:32:15.379
All I wanted was a normal life.

00:32:17.063 --> 00:32:20.426
There's no end to this

00:32:21.920 --> 00:32:25.287
unless one of us dies.

00:32:39.647 --> 00:32:41.322
Sang Ah.

00:32:45.438 --> 00:32:48.037
I'll keep you safe.

00:32:52.352 --> 00:32:54.960
Tell me what I should do.

00:33:04.022 --> 00:33:08.057
You know my mother died when I was little.

00:33:10.453 --> 00:33:13.145
I've lived on my own all this time.

00:33:16.622 --> 00:33:19.485
If that man were simply gone,

00:33:23.268 --> 00:33:26.533
we could have a life together.

00:33:45.772 --> 00:33:47.554
I...

00:33:51.101 --> 00:33:53.769
I want to be your woman.

00:34:00.027 --> 00:34:02.444
My entire future

00:34:03.814 --> 00:34:06.156
is yours.

00:34:12.407 --> 00:34:14.706
So, Jae Sang...

00:34:21.563 --> 00:34:24.341
Will you kill Oh Kwang Jae for me?

00:34:35.605 --> 00:34:37.880
A few days after, tidying her apartment,

00:34:37.880 --> 00:34:40.791
I came across a bug Oh Kwang Jae had hidden.

00:34:40.791 --> 00:34:42.520
So I took it out.

00:34:42.520 --> 00:34:44.376
This particular recording will be revealed

00:34:44.376 --> 00:34:46.772
in Part Two.

00:34:46.772 --> 00:34:49.359
Oh Kwang Jae was brutal, no doubt.

00:34:49.359 --> 00:34:52.616
But Chu Sang Ah weaponized her pain

00:34:52.616 --> 00:34:55.939
and played Mr. Park while putting on an act.

00:34:55.939 --> 00:34:58.868
She really is an actress through and through.

00:34:58.868 --> 00:34:59.981
Anyway,

00:34:59.981 --> 00:35:01.412
Park Jae Sang.

00:35:01.412 --> 00:35:04.960
Why not make that recording public back then?

00:35:04.960 --> 00:35:08.135
I trusted the word she gave me.

00:35:09.360 --> 00:35:11.221
Which one?

00:35:12.159 --> 00:35:15.434
That she'd stay with me after my release.

00:35:17.305 --> 00:35:19.430
But the moment I learned she betrayed that vow

00:35:19.430 --> 00:35:21.679
[Choi Ji Ho's Fact Check]

00:35:21.679 --> 00:35:24.902
and wed Bang Tae Seop,

00:35:25.689 --> 00:35:27.696
that's when I decided.

00:35:28.706 --> 00:35:31.408
I'd put this recording out there

00:35:32.757 --> 00:35:36.371
[Choi Ji Ho's Fact Check]
and reveal who they truly are.

00:36:02.557 --> 00:36:04.728
I listened to that recording.

00:36:05.643 --> 00:36:09.274
You should've warned me
that thing was out there.

00:36:12.689 --> 00:36:15.077
I had no idea it existed either.

00:36:16.502 --> 00:36:20.123
I took care of the USB, but a duplicate exists.

00:36:21.201 --> 00:36:23.735
If that surfaces, it's over for us.

00:36:23.735 --> 00:36:28.131
Your return to acting, my party nomination,
everything falls apart.

00:36:29.146 --> 00:36:31.969
Do you know what I sacrificed
to reach this point?

00:36:35.105 --> 00:36:37.425
What made you do it?

00:36:37.425 --> 00:36:39.685
There was no need to take it that far.

00:36:41.480 --> 00:36:44.022
When Ji Soo ended up like that,

00:36:44.730 --> 00:36:47.234
I lost my mind completely.

00:36:48.353 --> 00:36:51.505
Oh Kwang Jae turned my life into a nightmare.

00:36:51.505 --> 00:36:53.151
You know it!

00:36:53.151 --> 00:36:56.368
If he didn't die, I was the one who would!

00:37:08.069 --> 00:37:10.674
Even without what you did,

00:37:13.480 --> 00:37:15.762
Oh Kwang Jae still would've ended up dead.

00:37:21.730 --> 00:37:23.895
What is that supposed to mean?

00:37:26.522 --> 00:37:28.502
Whenever Oh Kwang Jae

00:37:28.502 --> 00:37:30.394
hosted big names,

00:37:30.394 --> 00:37:32.396
[Kwon Se Myeong, Oh Kwang Jae, Chu Sang Ah]
he'd have actresses accompany them.

00:37:32.396 --> 00:37:34.401
Testimonies from those actresses

00:37:34.401 --> 00:37:36.272
along with a document listing their names,

00:37:36.272 --> 00:37:40.571
he held onto it all as proof.

00:37:40.571 --> 00:37:41.933
To use as blackmail material.

00:37:41.933 --> 00:37:43.437
Exactly.

00:37:43.437 --> 00:37:47.203
That's why Oh Kwang Jae was out there

00:37:47.203 --> 00:37:49.722
boasting that cash would roll in soon enough.

00:37:49.722 --> 00:37:52.063
And one more thing.

00:37:52.063 --> 00:37:56.105
Here are the bloodstain test findings

00:37:56.105 --> 00:37:58.180
from the Seogwang Hotel murder scene.

00:38:01.300 --> 00:38:06.522
[The unidentified individual
is presumed to be Lim Kwang Sung]

00:38:06.522 --> 00:38:09.149
A hired assassination...

00:38:20.194 --> 00:38:24.576
Kwon Se Myeong, under pressure
from Oh Kwang Jae,

00:38:24.576 --> 00:38:27.793
commissioned the killing.

00:39:08.576 --> 00:39:12.469
[To Lim Kwang Sung, Motor Vehicle Tax Bill]

00:40:29.689 --> 00:40:34.805
[K Pictures CEO Oh Kwang Jae,
entered Room 408, 3 AM, the 13th]

00:41:15.578 --> 00:41:19.540
[Print 1, Print 2, Print 3, Print 4]

00:41:19.540 --> 00:41:24.222
[Fingerprint Subject, Jo Chang Min,
Matches Latent Print 1]

00:41:41.646 --> 00:41:43.734
Bang Tae Seop.

00:41:45.071 --> 00:41:47.409
You recognize these faces, don't you?

00:41:50.532 --> 00:41:51.864
No, sir.

00:41:51.864 --> 00:41:53.743
You were present. You saw them that evening.

00:41:53.743 --> 00:41:55.611
I'm not sure what you mean.

00:41:55.611 --> 00:41:57.419
I'm sorry.

00:41:59.647 --> 00:42:01.731
Good.

00:42:01.731 --> 00:42:04.043
All that you witnessed and heard that night?

00:42:04.043 --> 00:42:05.351
Nothing.

00:42:05.351 --> 00:42:07.699
I didn't see a thing. I didn't hear a thing.

00:42:07.699 --> 00:42:10.466
Exactly. You stayed home that evening.

00:42:10.466 --> 00:42:14.060
You first heard of him from news reports.

00:42:21.313 --> 00:42:23.778
This hits the papers tomorrow morning.

00:42:25.439 --> 00:42:32.018
["Film mogul Oh Kwang Jae killed
by Chu Sang Ah's bodyguard."]

00:42:34.866 --> 00:42:36.939
The suspect was apprehended on the spot.

00:42:36.939 --> 00:42:39.815
Why keep digging any further?

00:42:39.815 --> 00:42:41.789
Push this any harder

00:42:41.789 --> 00:42:45.615
and we only drag out connections
no one needs revealed.

00:42:45.615 --> 00:42:47.385
Sir.

00:42:48.988 --> 00:42:51.563
You should be heading to Special Division now.

00:42:51.563 --> 00:42:53.266
Isn't that so?

00:43:30.212 --> 00:43:33.135
[Based on all evidence, Chairman Kwon]

00:43:33.135 --> 00:43:35.308
[Se Myeong, via his director of staff...]

00:44:09.379 --> 00:44:11.089
Park Jae Sang got there before anyone

00:44:11.089 --> 00:44:14.097
yet only succeeded in attempted murder.

00:44:23.098 --> 00:44:26.939
Based on all gathered evidence,

00:44:26.939 --> 00:44:28.438
Chairman Kwon Se Myeong, through his director,

00:44:28.438 --> 00:44:32.490
directed Mr. Lim to murder Oh Kwang Jae.

00:44:37.855 --> 00:44:40.282
Mr. Lim showed up moments later

00:44:40.282 --> 00:44:42.993
and drove a blade into Oh Kwang Jae twice.

00:44:42.993 --> 00:44:46.215
Forensic evidence supports this conclusion.

00:44:47.397 --> 00:44:49.518
Without question,

00:44:49.518 --> 00:44:54.512
this is a hit commissioned by Chairman Kwon.

00:44:56.465 --> 00:44:57.859
[Print]

00:45:07.559 --> 00:45:11.871
[Criminal Case Records]

00:45:59.680 --> 00:46:03.206
We don't really have reason to meet, do we?

00:46:07.455 --> 00:46:11.631
This is evidence from the Oh Kwang Jae scene.

00:46:12.380 --> 00:46:16.670
His phone led us to two additional hard drives.

00:46:16.670 --> 00:46:22.134
Years' worth of footage, images, and audio.

00:46:22.134 --> 00:46:24.939
We pulled hundreds of files from them.

00:46:24.939 --> 00:46:26.573
What I brought here

00:46:26.573 --> 00:46:30.191
are strictly the files connected to you.

00:46:35.260 --> 00:46:37.323
So what did you think?

00:46:38.546 --> 00:46:40.618
Was it entertaining for you?

00:46:43.522 --> 00:46:45.542
Typically, evidence in a case is restricted

00:46:45.542 --> 00:46:48.510
to law enforcement and investigators.

00:46:48.510 --> 00:46:51.629
It's stored within the prosecution's office.

00:46:52.772 --> 00:46:55.080
However, this particular material,

00:46:55.080 --> 00:46:58.178
I'm prepared to put it all on the line

00:46:59.120 --> 00:47:01.598
to make it disappear on my own.

00:47:06.977 --> 00:47:08.814
Why would you do that?

00:47:08.814 --> 00:47:11.308
Because I understand what all of it represents.

00:47:11.308 --> 00:47:14.939
I know what it cost you to reach this point.

00:47:14.939 --> 00:47:16.863
All of it.

00:47:22.313 --> 00:47:24.416
Even now that Oh Kwang Jae is dead,

00:47:24.416 --> 00:47:28.477
others like Han Ji Soo will keep appearing.

00:47:28.477 --> 00:47:30.960
I'd like to prevent that from happening.

00:47:33.272 --> 00:47:36.633
That's a bold thing to say to a woman.

00:47:39.056 --> 00:47:41.387
Is that the card you're playing?

00:47:43.689 --> 00:47:46.772
It's an offer that serves you well.

00:47:46.772 --> 00:47:48.478
We see

00:47:49.683 --> 00:47:53.483
ourselves in those like us.

00:47:57.480 --> 00:47:59.489
Yeah, you're right.

00:48:00.696 --> 00:48:02.784
Most people wouldn't understand,

00:48:03.480 --> 00:48:05.620
but you do.

00:48:07.862 --> 00:48:11.167
You've seen everything

00:48:12.038 --> 00:48:14.170
I had to do to survive.

00:48:18.563 --> 00:48:20.156
I built my life

00:48:20.156 --> 00:48:23.061
over Han Ji Soo's grave

00:48:23.061 --> 00:48:27.100
and all the actresses who disappeared quietly.

00:48:29.306 --> 00:48:31.604
Because of them,

00:48:33.693 --> 00:48:36.484
I refuse to give up where I stand.

00:48:45.608 --> 00:48:48.037
I'll be right there next to you.

00:48:49.772 --> 00:48:52.162
Let's take this road side by side.

00:48:52.162 --> 00:48:54.522
After that,

00:48:54.522 --> 00:48:57.188
nobody will

00:48:57.188 --> 00:48:59.465
lay a finger on you.

00:49:03.939 --> 00:49:06.931
What makes you think you can keep me safe?

00:49:11.548 --> 00:49:13.355
At this moment,

00:49:13.355 --> 00:49:15.576
I'm just a hungry hound

00:49:15.576 --> 00:49:19.474
roaming free with no owner.

00:49:19.474 --> 00:49:21.482
I don't have a single thing to offer.

00:49:21.482 --> 00:49:24.157
I need a master who'll provide for me.

00:49:24.887 --> 00:49:26.826
And the one I want for that

00:49:27.563 --> 00:49:29.912
is you.

00:49:33.000 --> 00:49:36.210
You just need to remain beside me.

00:49:36.874 --> 00:49:40.183
Hold my hand, and down the line,

00:49:40.183 --> 00:49:43.384
once we hold genuine power,

00:49:45.151 --> 00:49:48.514
that becomes what you've earned.

00:49:49.430 --> 00:49:52.226
We can't do this without each other.

00:49:53.181 --> 00:49:55.056
Let's form a pact.

00:49:56.469 --> 00:50:00.860
Every secret of yours I've seen,

00:50:01.995 --> 00:50:04.655
I'll carry to my grave.

00:50:08.438 --> 00:50:10.578
Are you threatening me?

00:50:11.355 --> 00:50:13.456
It's a marriage proposal.

00:50:15.259 --> 00:50:16.918
I will

00:50:18.438 --> 00:50:20.797
be your accomplice.

00:50:33.010 --> 00:50:38.278
[Prosecutor Bang Tae Seop]

00:50:43.645 --> 00:50:47.736
[Criminal Case Records]

00:50:47.736 --> 00:50:51.529
[Arrest Warrant]

00:50:56.036 --> 00:50:57.792
In the end,

00:50:58.689 --> 00:51:02.417
Bang Tae Seop buried the truth

00:51:02.417 --> 00:51:04.882
[Case No. 2018-No-1087, Murder]
to keep Chu Sang Ah under his control.

00:51:14.689 --> 00:51:16.939
Jae Sang!

00:51:16.939 --> 00:51:19.431
Wait! Please, wait!

00:51:19.431 --> 00:51:21.230
Mom!

00:51:21.230 --> 00:51:22.438
- Jae Sang!
- Wait!

00:51:22.438 --> 00:51:25.105
- Mom!
- You didn't do this!

00:51:25.105 --> 00:51:28.355
- Mom!
- It wasn't you!

00:51:28.355 --> 00:51:31.701
Mom!

00:51:48.939 --> 00:51:51.637
No.

00:51:53.110 --> 00:51:55.141
There was

00:51:56.272 --> 00:51:59.109
no other way for me

00:51:59.109 --> 00:52:01.814
except to become a killer.

00:52:22.860 --> 00:52:25.522
So what you're saying is

00:52:25.522 --> 00:52:27.855
you knew Kwon Se Myeong was the true culprit

00:52:27.855 --> 00:52:29.501
and you covered it up?

00:52:29.501 --> 00:52:31.814
Yeah. Kwon Se Myeong did it.

00:52:31.814 --> 00:52:35.160
He pressured it from the top.
What could I have done?

00:52:35.160 --> 00:52:37.272
You think making a scene then would've made

00:52:37.272 --> 00:52:39.602
- any difference?
- Bang Tae Seop!

00:52:43.974 --> 00:52:46.220
I've kept the proof from that time.

00:52:46.220 --> 00:52:50.655
I've been saving it to bring down WR
at the right moment.

00:52:52.563 --> 00:52:55.652
You're just the same.

00:52:55.652 --> 00:52:59.414
Why did you keep this from me all these years?

00:52:59.414 --> 00:53:01.908
If you had revealed it at the time,

00:53:01.908 --> 00:53:03.869
I never would've married you. Am I wrong?

00:53:03.869 --> 00:53:06.621
Watch what you say.

00:53:06.621 --> 00:53:09.374
We're not at that point yet.

00:53:09.374 --> 00:53:11.588
Son of a bitch.

00:53:11.588 --> 00:53:13.022
Even if I'm the sort of garbage

00:53:13.022 --> 00:53:15.130
who pulled an innocent person into this

00:53:15.130 --> 00:53:17.772
and wrecked his life to keep myself alive,

00:53:17.772 --> 00:53:21.386
I've carried a heavy burden of guilt.

00:53:21.386 --> 00:53:23.397
Do you understand?

00:53:23.397 --> 00:53:25.891
Not one day!

00:53:25.891 --> 00:53:28.205
There wasn't a moment
I didn't remember that night.

00:53:28.205 --> 00:53:30.027
Damn it.

00:53:31.021 --> 00:53:36.367
Okay. Just settle down first.

00:53:39.981 --> 00:53:41.789
You

00:53:42.657 --> 00:53:45.688
only looked at me as a celebrity

00:53:45.688 --> 00:53:48.713
to exploit for your big plans.

00:53:58.939 --> 00:54:00.558
Yeah.

00:54:02.146 --> 00:54:03.811
I know.

00:54:09.897 --> 00:54:12.695
It's my fault for marrying a killer.

00:54:18.063 --> 00:54:19.827
Damn it...

00:54:23.230 --> 00:54:25.468
Son of a bitch.

00:55:58.855 --> 00:56:00.511
I know.

00:56:01.841 --> 00:56:04.682
It's my fault for marrying a killer.

00:56:20.148 --> 00:56:22.950
Hey! You okay?

00:56:25.820 --> 00:56:26.939
Are you hurt?

00:56:26.939 --> 00:56:29.022
Hey!

00:56:29.022 --> 00:56:30.440
What?

00:56:30.440 --> 00:56:32.324
She's the one who messed up.

00:56:41.063 --> 00:56:42.939
Are you okay?

00:56:42.939 --> 00:56:45.139
Are you hurt anywhere?

00:56:46.272 --> 00:56:48.438
[Chu Sang Ah, accused of killing Oh Kwang Jae]

00:56:48.438 --> 00:56:50.478
Isn't she Chu Sang Ah?

00:57:04.855 --> 00:57:07.410
[Chu Sang Ah's two faces... what is the truth?]

00:57:10.490 --> 00:57:17.268
[Chu Sang Ah, accused of killing Oh Kwang Jae]

00:58:31.272 --> 00:58:33.188
You think a woman with blood on her hands

00:58:33.188 --> 00:58:34.976
could actually amount to anything?

00:58:34.976 --> 00:58:36.556
I'm sorry.

00:58:36.556 --> 00:58:38.196
Please forgive me.

00:58:38.196 --> 00:58:40.796
You went through hell this whole time too?

00:58:40.796 --> 00:58:42.855
I won't go down alone.

00:58:42.855 --> 00:58:44.577
One wrong move on the Oh Kwang Jae case

00:58:44.577 --> 00:58:47.036
and our entire family is finished.

00:58:47.036 --> 00:58:48.156
What?

00:58:48.156 --> 00:58:51.016
Might this birthday be your final one?

00:58:51.016 --> 00:58:53.176
What I've kept hidden for all these years

00:58:53.176 --> 00:58:55.981
without ever using it

00:58:55.981 --> 00:58:58.647
is my trump card.